{"id":"Wa44c7a00f64b0d8eb603c3c4","zh":"随机振动","en":"","name":"随机振动","language":"zh","domain":"车辆—轨道与基础结构动力学","concept_id":null,"families":[],"definition_zh":null,"definition_en":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_note":"random analysis 与 stochastic analysis 在所引文献中并用，不能据此将所有含 random 与 stochastic 的方法名称视为同义。","usage_overview":null,"translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[],"designations":[{"id":"Wa44c7a00f64b0d8eb603c3c4","text":"随机振动","language":"zh","role":"headword"}],"complete_examples":[{"id":"S2bf7aec5cbfaac25cbc8","source_id":"P113","page":1,"page_end":1,"language":"zh","text":"最后,采用该模型分析了不同变异系数下的车辆-轨道系统时-空随机振动,分析中假定系统动力参数服从正态分布,并基于实测数据进行轨道不平顺的时-空随机模拟。","citations":[{"source_id":"P113","page":1,"page_end":1}]},{"id":"Sd8b9a25cdf4be1faa75a","source_id":"P113","page":5,"page_end":5,"language":"zh","text":"采用时-空随机振动计算方法,不同指标响应的概率分布pX,Θ (xi,θJ)可以计算出来, 只需给定指标限值xi,可直接计算、使用可靠度,获得失效概率。","citations":[{"source_id":"P113","page":5,"page_end":5}]},{"id":"S90d5607214c10aaaeb09","source_id":"P115","page":2,"page_end":2,"language":"zh","text":"车辆-轨道系统的随机振动特性主要来源于激振源和系统参数的随机性,考虑到车辆-轨道系统理论计算条件与实际物理、力学状态间的差异,以及常规计算中激振源和车线参数的不完备性与时效不变性,亟待开展车辆-轨道系统的随机分析 [1-6]。","citations":[{"source_id":"P115","page":2,"page_end":2}]},{"id":"S6ca9b309fd66f50d587a","source_id":"P118","page":5,"page_end":5,"language":"zh","text":"概率密度函数(PDF)抓住了随机动力响应幅值和概率两方面的特性,是分析随机振动统计信息的有力工具,也是动力可靠度计算的基础。","citations":[{"source_id":"P118","page":5,"page_end":5}]},{"id":"S0f5e3d17fa48764eb4e5","source_id":"P118","page":5,"page_end":5,"language":"zh","text":"显然,上述分析是随机振动计算时某一确定性工况下的计算分析,由车轮踏面磨耗的随机性可知,Ci(i =1,2,...,9)仅代表磨耗均值,各踏面点的磨耗量还存在变异性,再考虑C0工况下轨道不平顺的随机性,可知将车轮磨耗与轨道不平顺两者做随机激励考虑时, 车辆-轨道系统的动力响应无法用确定性分析(图2) 描述。","citations":[{"source_id":"P118","page":5,"page_end":5}]}],"sources":{"P003":{"id":"P003","title":"A probabilistic model for track random irregularities in vehicle/track coupled dynamics","authors":"L Xu, W Zhai, J Gao","year":"2017","doi":"10.1016/j.apm.2017.06.027","journal_citation":"Applied Mathematical Modelling 51, 145-158","label":"Xu等（2017）","overview_slug":"xu-2017-track-irregularity"},"P007":{"id":"P007","title":"On effects of track random irregularities on random vibrations of vehicle–track interactions","authors":"L Xu, W Zhai, J Gao, M Meacci, X Chen","year":"2017","doi":"10.1016/j.probengmech.2017.10.002","journal_citation":"Probabilistic Engineering Mechanics 50, 25-35","label":"Xu等（2017）","overview_slug":"2017-track-irregularity-random-vibrations"},"P010":{"id":"P010","title":"A coupled model for train-track-bridge stochastic analysis with consideration of spatial variation and temporal evolution","authors":"L Xu, W Zhai, Z Li","year":"2018","doi":"10.1016/j.apm.2018.07.001","journal_citation":"Applied Mathematical Modelling 63, 709-731","label":"Xu等（2018）","overview_slug":"2018-a-coupled-model-for-train-track-bridge-stochastic-analysis-with-consideration-of-spatial-variation-a"},"P011":{"id":"P011","title":"A model for vehicle–track random interactions on effects of crosswinds and track irregularities","authors":"L Xu, W Zhai","year":"2019","doi":"10.1080/00423114.2018.1469775","journal_citation":"Vehicle system dynamics 57 (3), 444-469","label":"Xu等（2019）","overview_slug":"2019-a-model-for-vehicle-track-random-interactions-on-effects-of-crosswinds-and-track-irregularities"},"P016":{"id":"P016","title":"Probabilistic assessment of railway vehicle-curved track systems considering track random irregularities","authors":"L Xu, W Zhai","year":"2018","doi":"10.1080/00423114.2018.1424916","journal_citation":"Vehicle System Dynamics 56 (10), 1552-1576","label":"Xu等（2018）","overview_slug":"2018-probabilistic-assessment-of-railway-vehicle-curved-track-systems-considering-track-random-irregulari"},"P046":{"id":"P046","title":"Vehicle-track random vibrations considering spatial frequency coherence of track irregularitives","authors":"L Xu, Y Zhao, Z Zhu, Z Li, H Liu, Z Yu","year":"2022","doi":"10.1080/00423114.2021.1986224","journal_citation":"Vehicle System Dynamics 6